set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000 in
/-- **The parse tie, decided**: the container bytes parse sealed,
single-commit, to exactly the banked dep and op literals — the
production decoder (which wrote the literals) and the Lean reference
reader (which the kernel runs here) agree on these bytes. -/
